#, no-wrap
msgid "Fl P Ar port"
msgstr "Fl P Ar port"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid "Specifies the port to connect to on the remote host."
msgstr ""
"Cette option permet de spécifier le port auquel se connecter sur l'hôte "
"distant."

#. type: It
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fl p"
msgstr "Fl p"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid ""
"Preserves modification times, access times, and modes from the original "
"files transferred."
msgstr ""
"Préserver les dates de modifications, d'accès et les modes des fichiers "
"transférés."

#. type: It
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fl q"
msgstr "Fl q"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid ""
"Quiet mode: disables the progress meter as well as warning and diagnostic "
"messages from E<.Xr ssh 1>."
msgstr ""
"Mode silencieux : la barre de progression ainsi que les messages "
"d’avertissement et de diagnostic en provenance de E<.Xr ssh 1> sont "
"désactivés."

#. type: It
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fl R Ar num_requests"
msgstr "Fl R Ar nombre_requêtes"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid ""
"Specify how many requests may be outstanding at any one time.  Increasing "
"this may slightly improve file transfer speed but will increase memory "
"usage.  The default is 64 outstanding requests."
msgstr ""
"Cette option permet de spécifier le nombre de requêtes pouvant être en "
"attente à un instant donné. Augmenter ce nombre améliorera légèrement la "
"vitesse de transfert des fichiers, mais augmentera la consommation de "
"mémoire. La valeur par défaut est de 64 requêtes en attente."

#. type: It
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fl r"
msgstr "Fl r"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid ""
"Recursively copy entire directories when uploading and downloading.  Note "
"that E<.Nm> does not follow symbolic links encountered in the tree traversal."
msgstr ""
"Copier récursivement les répertoires complets lors d’un téléversement ou "
"d’un téléchargement. Notez que E<.Nm> ne suit pas les liens symboliques "
"rencontrés lors du parcours de l'arborescence."

#. type: It
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fl S Ar program"
msgstr "Fl S Ar programme"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid ""
"Name of the E<.Ar program> to use for the encrypted connection.  The program "
"must understand E<.Xr ssh 1> options."
msgstr ""
"Cette option permet de spécifier le nom du E<.Ar programme> à utiliser pour "
"la connexion chiffrée. Ce programme doit prendre en charge les options de E<."
"Xr ssh 1>."

#. type: It
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fl s Ar subsystem | sftp_server"
msgstr "Fl s Ar sous_système | serveur_sftp"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid ""
"Specifies the SSH2 subsystem or the path for an sftp server on the remote "
"host.  A path is useful when the remote E<.Xr sshd 8> does not have an sftp "
"subsystem configured."
msgstr ""
"Cette option permet de spécifier le sous-sytème SSH2 ou le chemin d'un "
"serveur sftp sur l'hôte distant. Un tel chemin s’avère utile lorsque que le "
"démon E<.Xr sshd 8> distant n'a pas de sous-système sftp configuré."

#. type: It
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fl v"
msgstr "Fl v"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid "Raise logging level.  This option is also passed to ssh."
msgstr ""
"Augmenter le niveau de journalisation. Cette option est aussi passée à E<.Xr "
"ssh 1>."

#. type: It
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fl X Ar sftp_option"
msgstr "Fl X Ar option_sftp"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid ""
"Specify an option that controls aspects of SFTP protocol behaviour.  The "
"valid options are:"
msgstr ""
"Cette option permet de spécifier une option qui contrôle certains aspects du "
"comportement du protocole SFTP. Les options disponibles sont :"

#. type: It
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "Cm nrequests Ns = Ns Ar value"
msgstr "Cm nrequests Ns = Ns Ar valeur"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid ""
"Controls how many concurrent SFTP read or write requests may be in progress "
"at any point in time during a download or upload.  By default 64 requests "
"may be active concurrently."
msgstr ""
"Cette option permet de définir le nombre de requêtes SFTP de lecture ou "
"d’écriture qui peuvent être traitées simultanément au cours d’un "
"téléchargement ou d’un téléversement. Par défaut, 64 requêtes peuvent être "
"traitées simultanément."

#. type: It
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "Cm buffer Ns = Ns Ar value"
msgstr "Cm buffer Ns = Ns Ar valeur"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid ""
"Controls the maximum buffer size for a single SFTP read/write operation used "
"during download or upload.  By default a 32KB buffer is used."
msgstr ""
"Cette option permet de définir la taille maximale du tampon utilisé lors "
"d’un téléchargement ou d’un téléversement pour une seule opération SFTP de "
"lecture/écriture. La valeur par défaut est de 32 ko."

#. type: Sh
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "INTERACTIVE COMMANDS"
msgstr "COMMANDES INTERACTIVES"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid ""
"Once in interactive mode, E<.Nm> understands a set of commands similar to "
"those of E<.Xr ftp 1>.  Commands are case insensitive.  Pathnames that "
"contain spaces must be enclosed in quotes.  Any special characters contained "
"within pathnames that are recognized by E<.Xr glob 3> must be escaped with "
"backslashes E<.Pq Sq \\e>."
msgstr ""
"En mode interactif, E<.Nm> prend en charge un jeu de commandes similaires à "
"celles de E<.Xr ftp 1>. Les commandes sont insensibles à la casse. Les noms "
"des chemins contenant des espaces doivent être entourés de guillemets droits "
"simples (« ' »). Tout caractère spécial contenu dans un nom de chemin et "
"reconnu par E<.Xr glob 3> doit être protégé par une barre oblique inverse "
"(« \\ »)."

#. type: It
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ic bye"
msgstr "Ic bye"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid "Quit E<.Nm sftp>."
msgstr "Quitter E<.Nm sftp>."

#. type: It
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ic cd Op Ar path"
msgstr "Ic cd Op Ar chemin"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid ""
"Change remote directory to E<.Ar path>.  If E<.Ar path> is not specified, "
"then change directory to the one the session started in."
msgstr ""
"Changer le répertoire distant pour E<.Ar chemin>. Si E<.Ar chemin> n’est pas "
"spécifié, changer le répertoire pour celui sous lequel la session a démarré."

#. type: It
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "Xo Ic chgrp"
msgstr "Xo Ic chgrp"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid ""
"E<.Op Fl h> E<.Ar grp> E<.Ar path> E<.Xc> Change group of file E<.Ar path> "
"to E<.Ar grp>.  E<.Ar path> may contain E<.Xr glob 7> characters and may "
"match multiple files.  E<.Ar grp> must be a numeric GID."
msgstr ""
"E<.Op Fl h> E<.Ar grp> E<.Ar chemin> E<.Xc> Changer le groupe du fichier E<."
"Ar chemin> à E<.Ar grp>. E<.Ar chemin> peut contenir des caractères E<.Xr "
"glob 7> et peut correspondre à plusieurs fichiers. E<.Ar grp> doit être un "
"GID numérique."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid ""
"If the E<.Fl h> flag is specified, then symlinks will not be followed.  Note "
"that this is only supported by servers that implement the \"lsetstat@openssh."
"com\" extension."
msgstr ""
"Si l’option E<.Fl h> est spécifiée, les liens symboliques ne seront pas "
"suivis. Notez que cette fonctionnalité n’est prise en charge que par les "
"serveurs qui implémentent l’extension « lsetstat@openssh.com »."

#. type: It
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "Xo Ic chmod"
msgstr "Xo Ic chmod"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid ""
"E<.Op Fl h> E<.Ar mode> E<.Ar path> E<.Xc> Change permissions of file E<.Ar "
"path> to E<.Ar mode>.  E<.Ar path> may contain E<.Xr glob 7> characters and "
"may match multiple files."
msgstr ""
"E<.Op Fl h> E<.Ar mode> E<.Ar chemin> E<.Xc> Changer les permissions du "
"fichier E<.Ar path> à E<.Ar mode>. E<.Ar chemin> peut contenir des "
"caractères E<.Xr glob 7> et peut correspondre à plusieurs fichiers."

#. type: It
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "Xo Ic chown"
msgstr "Xo Ic chown"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid ""
"E<.Op Fl h> E<.Ar own> E<.Ar path> E<.Xc> Change owner of file E<.Ar path> "
"to E<.Ar own>.  E<.Ar path> may contain E<.Xr glob 7> characters and may "
"match multiple files.  E<.Ar own> must be a numeric UID."
msgstr ""
"E<.Op Fl h> E<.Ar propriétaire> E<.Ar chemin> E<.Xc> Changer le propriétaire "
"du fichier E<.Ar chemin> à E<.Ar propriétaire>. E<.Ar chemin> peut contenir "
"des caractères E<.Xr glob 7> et peut correspondre à plusieurs fichiers. E<."
"Ar propriétaire> doit être un UID numérique."

#. type: It
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ic copy Ar oldpath Ar newpath"
msgstr "Ic copy Ar ancien_chemin Ar nouveau_chemin"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid "Copy remote file from E<.Ar oldpath> to E<.Ar newpath>."
msgstr ""
"Copier le fichier distant de E<.Ar ancien_chemin> vers E<.Ar nouveau_chemin>."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid ""
"Note that this is only supported by servers that implement the \"copy-data\" "
"extension."
msgstr ""
"Notez que cette fonctionnalité n’est prise en charge que par les serveurs "
"qui implémentent l’extension « copy-data »."

#. type: It
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ic cp Ar oldpath Ar newpath"
msgstr "Ic cp Ar ancien_chemin Ar nouveau_chemin"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid "Alias to E<.Ic copy> command."
msgstr "Alias de la commande E<.Ic copy>."

#. type: It
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "Xo Ic df"
msgstr "Xo Ic df"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid ""
"E<.Op Fl hi> E<.Op Ar path> E<.Xc> Display usage information for the "
"filesystem holding the current directory (or E<.Ar path> if specified).  If "
"the E<.Fl h> flag is specified, the capacity information will be displayed "
"using \"human-readable\" suffixes.  The E<.Fl i> flag requests display of "
"inode information in addition to capacity information.  This command is only "
"supported on servers that implement the E<.Dq statvfs@openssh.com> extension."
msgstr ""
"E<.Op Fl hi> E<.Op Ar chemin> E<.Xc> Afficher les informations d’utilisation "
"du système de fichiers contenant le répertoire actuel (ou E<.Ar chemin> si "
"spécifié). Si l’option E<.Fl h> est spécifiée, les informations "
"d’utilisation seront affichées avec des suffixes « lisibles par les "
"humains ». Le drapeau E<.Fl i> demande l'affichage des numéros d'inodes en "
"plus des informations d’utilisation. Cette commande n’est prise en charge "
"que par les serveurs qui implémentent l'extension « statvfs@openssh.com »."

#. type: It
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ic exit"
msgstr "Ic exit"

#. type: It
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "Xo Ic get"
msgstr "Xo Ic get"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid ""
"E<.Op Fl afpR> E<.Ar remote-path> E<.Op Ar local-path> E<.Xc> Retrieve the "
"E<.Ar remote-path> and store it on the local machine.  If the local path "
"name is not specified, it is given the same name it has on the remote "
"machine.  E<.Ar remote-path> may contain E<.Xr glob 7> characters and may "
"match multiple files.  If it does and E<.Ar local-path> is specified, then "
"E<.Ar local-path> must specify a directory."
msgstr ""
"E<.Op Fl afpR> E<.Ar chemin_distant> E<.Op Ar chemin_local> E<.Xc> Récupérer "
"l'emplacement E<.Ar chemin_distant> et le stocker sur la machine locale. Si "
"le nom d'emplacement local n'est pas spécifié, il adoptera le même nom que "
"sur l’hôte distant. E<.Ar chemin_distant> peut contenir des caractères E<.Xr "
"glob 7> et peut correspondre à plusieurs fichiers. Si c'est le cas et si un "
"E<.Ar chemin_local> est spécifié, E<.Ar chemin_local> doit correspondre à un "
"répertoire."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid ""
"If the E<.Fl a> flag is specified, then attempt to resume partial transfers "
"of existing files.  Note that resumption assumes that any partial copy of "
"the local file matches the remote copy.  If the remote file contents differ "
"from the partial local copy then the resultant file is likely to be corrupt."
msgstr ""
"Si l’option E<.Fl a> est spécifiée, tenter de reprendre les transferts "
"partiels des fichiers existants. Notez que la reprise suppose que toute "
"copie partielle du fichier local correspond à la copie distante. Si le "
"contenu du fichier distant diffère de celui de la copie partielle locale, le "
"fichier résultant sera probablement corrompu."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid ""
"If the E<.Fl f> flag is specified, then E<.Xr fsync 2> will be called after "
"the file transfer has completed to flush the file to disk."
msgstr ""
"Si l’option E<.Fl f> est spécifiée, E<.Xr fsync 2> sera appelé après le "
"transfert complet du fichier pour enregistrer ce dernier sur disque."

#.  undocumented redundant alias
#.  or
#.  .Fl P
#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid ""
"If the E<.Fl p> flag is specified, then full file permissions and access "
"times are copied too."
msgstr ""
"Si l’option E<.Fl p> est spécifiée, les permissions complètes du fichier et "
"les heures d'accès seront aussi conservées."

#.  undocumented redundant alias
#.  or
#.  .Fl r
#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid ""
"If the E<.Fl R> flag is specified then directories will be copied "
"recursively.  Note that E<.Nm> does not follow symbolic links when "
"performing recursive transfers."
msgstr ""
"Si l’option E<.Fl R> est spécifiée, les répertoires seront copiés "
"récursivement. Notez que E<.Nm> ne suit pas les liens symboliques lors de "
"transferts récursifs."

#. type: It
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ic help"
msgstr "Ic help"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid "Display help text."
msgstr "Afficher le texte de l'aide."

#. type: It
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ic lcd Op Ar path"
msgstr "Ic lcd Op Ar chemin"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid ""
"Change local directory to E<.Ar path>.  If E<.Ar path> is not specified, "
"then change directory to the local user's home directory."
msgstr ""
"Changer le répertoire local en E<.Ar chemin>. Si E<.Ar chemin> n’est pas "
"spécifié, changer le répertoire pour le répertoire personnel de "
"l’utilisateur local."

#. type: It
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ic lls Op Ar ls-options Op Ar path"
msgstr "Ic lls Op Ar options_ls Op Ar chemin"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid ""
"Display local directory listing of either E<.Ar path> or current directory "
"if E<.Ar path> is not specified.  E<.Ar ls-options> may contain any flags "
"supported by the local system's E<.Xr ls 1> command.  E<.Ar path> may "
"contain E<.Xr glob 7> characters and may match multiple files."
msgstr ""
"Afficher la liste des fichiers du répertoire local E<.Ar chemin> ou du "
"répertoire local actuel si E<.Ar chemin> n'est pas spécifié. E<.Ar "
"options_ls> peut contenir n'importe quelle option prise en charge par la "
"commande E<.Xr ls 1> du système local. E<.Ar chemin> peut contenir des "
"caractères E<.Xr glob 7> et peut correspondre à plusieurs fichiers."

#. type: It
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ic lmkdir Ar path"
msgstr "Ic lmkdir Ar chemin"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid "Create local directory specified by E<.Ar path>."
msgstr "Créer le répertoire local spécifié par E<.Ar chemin>."

#. type: It
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "Xo Ic ln"
msgstr "Xo Ic ln"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid ""
"E<.Op Fl s> E<.Ar oldpath> E<.Ar newpath> E<.Xc> Create a link from E<.Ar "
"oldpath> to E<.Ar newpath>.  If the E<.Fl s> flag is specified the created "
"link is a symbolic link, otherwise it is a hard link."
msgstr ""
"E<.Op Fl s> E<.Ar ancien_chemin> E<.Ar nouveau_chemin> E<.Xc> Créer un lien "
"de E<.Ar ancien_chemin> à E<.Ar nouveau_chemin>. Si l’option E<.Fl s> est "
"spécifiée, le lien créé sera un lien symbolique, sinon ce sera un lien "
"physique."

#. type: It
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ic lpwd"
msgstr "Ic lpwd"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid "Print local working directory."
msgstr "Afficher le répertoire de travail local."

#. type: It
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "Xo Ic ls"
msgstr "Xo Ic ls"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid ""
"E<.Op Fl 1afhlnrSt> E<.Op Ar path> E<.Xc> Display a remote directory listing "
"of either E<.Ar path> or the current directory if E<.Ar path> is not "
"specified.  E<.Ar path> may contain E<.Xr glob 7> characters and may match "
"multiple files."
msgstr ""
"E<.Op Fl 1afhlnrSt> E<.Op Ar chemin> E<.Xc> Afficher la liste des fichiers "
"du répertoire distant E<.Ar chemin> ou du répertoire actuel si E<.Ar chemin> "
"n'est pas spécifié. E<.Ar chemin> peut contenir des caractères E<.Xr glob 7> "
"et peut correspondre à plusieurs fichiers."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid ""
"The following flags are recognized and alter the behaviour of E<.Ic ls> "
"accordingly:"
msgstr ""
"Les options suivantes sont reconnues et modifient le comportement de E<.Ic "
"ls> en conséquence :"

#. type: It
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fl 1"
msgstr "Fl 1"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid "Produce single columnar output."
msgstr "Produire une sortie sur une seule colonne."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid "List files beginning with a dot E<.Pq Sq \\&.>."
msgstr "Lister les fichiers dont le nom commence par un point « . »."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid "Do not sort the listing.  The default sort order is lexicographical."
msgstr "Ne pas trier la liste. L’ordre de tri par défaut est lexicographique."

#. type: It
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fl h"
msgstr "Fl h"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid ""
"When used with a long format option, use unit suffixes: Byte, Kilobyte, "
"Megabyte, Gigabyte, Terabyte, Petabyte, and Exabyte in order to reduce the "
"number of digits to four or fewer using powers of 2 for sizes (K=1024, "
"M=1048576, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"Avec l'option de format long, utiliser les suffixes d'unité : Octet, "
"Kilooctet, Megaoctet, Gigaoctet, Teraoctet, Petaoctet et Exaoctet pour "
"réduire le nombre de chiffres à quatre ou moins à l'aide de puissances de 2 "
"pour les tailles (K=1024, M=1048576, etc.)."

#. type: It
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fl l"
msgstr "Fl l"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid ""
"Display additional details including permissions and ownership information."
msgstr ""
"Afficher des informations supplémentaires dont les permissions et le "
"propriétaire."

#. type: It
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fl n"
msgstr "Fl n"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid ""
"Produce a long listing with user and group information presented numerically."
msgstr ""
"Produire une longue liste avec les informations sur le propriétaire et le "
"groupe présentées de manière numérique."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid "Reverse the sort order of the listing."
msgstr "Inverser l'ordre de tri de la liste."

#. type: It
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fl S"
msgstr "Fl S"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid "Sort the listing by file size."
msgstr "Trier la liste par taille de fichier."

#. type: It
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fl t"
msgstr "Fl t"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid "Sort the listing by last modification time."
msgstr "Trier la liste par date de dernière modification."

#. type: It
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ic lumask Ar umask"
msgstr "Ic lumask Ar umask"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid "Set local umask to E<.Ar umask>."
msgstr "Définir l'umask (mode de création de fichier) local à E<.Ar umask>."

#. type: It
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ic mkdir Ar path"
msgstr "Ic mkdir Ar chemin"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid "Create remote directory specified by E<.Ar path>."
msgstr "Créer le répertoire distant spécifié par E<.Ar chemin>."

#. type: It
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ic progress"
msgstr "Ic progress"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid "Toggle display of progress meter."
msgstr "Activer l'affichage de la barre de progression."

#. type: It
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "Xo Ic put"
msgstr "Xo Ic put"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid ""
"E<.Op Fl afpR> E<.Ar local-path> E<.Op Ar remote-path> E<.Xc> Upload E<.Ar "
"local-path> and store it on the remote machine.  If the remote path name is "
"not specified, it is given the same name it has on the local machine.  E<.Ar "
"local-path> may contain E<.Xr glob 7> characters and may match multiple "
"files.  If it does and E<.Ar remote-path> is specified, then E<.Ar remote-"
"path> must specify a directory."
msgstr ""
"E<.Op Fl afpR> E<.Ar chemin_local> E<.Op Ar chemin_distant> E<.Xc> "
"Téléverser l'emplacement E<.Ar chemin_local> et le stocker sur l’hôte "
"distant. Si le chemin distant n'est pas spécifié, il adoptera le même nom "
"que sur la machine locale. E<.Ar chemin_local> peut contenir des caractères "
"E<.Xr glob 7> et peut correspondre à plusieurs fichiers. Si c'est le cas et "
"si un E<.Ar chemin_distant> est spécifié, ce dernier doit correspondre à un "
"répertoire.  "

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid ""
"If the E<.Fl a> flag is specified, then attempt to resume partial transfers "
"of existing files.  Note that resumption assumes that any partial copy of "
"the remote file matches the local copy.  If the local file contents differ "
"from the remote local copy then the resultant file is likely to be corrupt."
msgstr ""
"Si l’option E<.Fl a> est spécifiée, tenter de reprendre les transferts "
"partiels des fichiers existants. Notez que la reprise suppose que toute "
"copie partielle du fichier distant correspond à la copie locale. Si le "
"contenu du fichier local diffère de celui de la copie partielle distante, le "
"fichier résultant sera probablement corrompu."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid ""
"If the E<.Fl f> flag is specified, then a request will be sent to the server "
"to call E<.Xr fsync 2> after the file has been transferred.  Note that this "
"is only supported by servers that implement the \"fsync@openssh.com\" "
"extension."
msgstr ""
"Si l’option E<.Fl f> est spécifiée, il sera demandé au serveur d’appeler E<."
"Xr fsync 2> une fois le transfert du fichier terminé. Notez que cette "
"fonctionnalité n’est prise en charge que par les serveurs qui implémentent "
"l’extension « fsync@openssh.com »."

#. type: It
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ic pwd"
msgstr "Ic pwd"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid "Display remote working directory."
msgstr "Affiche le répertoire de travail distant."

#. type: It
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ic quit"
msgstr "Ic quit"

#. type: It
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "Xo Ic reget"
msgstr "Xo Ic reget"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid ""
"E<.Op Fl fpR> E<.Ar remote-path> E<.Op Ar local-path> E<.Xc> Resume download "
"of E<.Ar remote-path>.  Equivalent to E<.Ic get> with the E<.Fl a> flag set."
msgstr ""
"E<.Op Fl fpR> E<.Ar chemin_distant> E<.Op Ar chemin_local> E<.Xc> Reprendre "
"le téléchargement de E<.Ar chemin_distant>. Équivalent à E<.Ic get> avec le "
"drapeau E<.Fl a> défini."

#. type: It
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "Xo Ic reput"
msgstr "Xo Ic reput"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid ""
"E<.Op Fl fpR> E<.Ar local-path> E<.Op Ar remote-path> E<.Xc> Resume upload "
"of E<.Ar local-path>.  Equivalent to E<.Ic put> with the E<.Fl a> flag set."
msgstr ""
"E<.Op Fl fpR> E<.Ar chemin_local> E<.Op Ar chemin_distant> E<.Xc> Reprendre "
"le téléversement de E<.Ar chemin_local>. Équivalent à E<.Ic put> avec le "
"drapeau E<.Fl a> défini."

#. type: It
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ic rename Ar oldpath newpath"
msgstr "Ic rename Ar ancien_chemin nouveau_chemin"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid "Rename remote file from E<.Ar oldpath> to E<.Ar newpath>."
msgstr ""
"Renommer le fichier distant E<.Ar ancien_chemin> en E<.Ar nouveau_chemin>."

#. type: It
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ic rm Ar path"
msgstr "Ic rm Ar chemin"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid "Delete remote file specified by E<.Ar path>."
msgstr "Supprimer le fichier distant spécifié par l'emplacement E<.Ar chemin>."

#. type: It
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ic rmdir Ar path"
msgstr "Ic rmdir Ar chemin"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid "Remove remote directory specified by E<.Ar path>."
msgstr ""
"Supprimer le répertoire distant spécifié par l'emplacement E<.Ar chemin>."

#. type: It
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ic symlink Ar oldpath newpath"
msgstr "Ic symlink Ar ancien_chemin nouveau_chemin"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid "Create a symbolic link from E<.Ar oldpath> to E<.Ar newpath>."
msgstr ""
"Créer un lien symbolique de E<.Ar ancien_chemin> vers E<.Ar nouveau_chemin>."

#. type: It
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ic version"
msgstr "Ic version"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid "Display the E<.Nm> protocol version."
msgstr "Afficher la version du protocole de E<.Nm>."

#. type: It
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ic \\&! Ns Ar command"
msgstr "Ic \\&! Ns Ar commande"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid "Execute E<.Ar command> in local shell."
msgstr "Exécuter la E<.Ar commande> dans l’interpréteur de commande local."

#. type: It
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ic \\&!"
msgstr "Ic \\&!"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid "Escape to local shell."
msgstr "Basculer dans l’interpréteur de commande local."

#. type: It
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ic \\&?"
msgstr "Ic \\&?"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid "Synonym for help."
msgstr "Synonyme pour aide."

#. type: Sh
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "SEE ALSO"
msgstr "VOIR AUSSI"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid ""
"E<.Xr ftp 1>, E<.Xr ls 1>, E<.Xr scp 1>, E<.Xr ssh 1>, E<.Xr ssh-add 1>, E<."
"Xr ssh-keygen 1>, E<.Xr ssh_config 5>, E<.Xr glob 7>, E<.Xr sftp-server 8>, "
"E<.Xr sshd 8> E<.Rs> E<.%A T. Ylonen> E<.%A S. Lehtinen> E<.%T \"SSH File "
"Transfer Protocol\"> E<.%N draft-ietf-secsh-filexfer-00.txt> E<.%D January "
"2001> E<.%O work in progress material> E<.Re>"
msgstr ""
"E<.Xr ftp 1>, E<.Xr ls 1>, E<.Xr scp 1>, E<.Xr ssh 1>, E<.Xr ssh-add 1>, E<."
"Xr ssh-keygen 1>, E<.Xr ssh_config 5>, E<.Xr glob 7>, E<.Xr sftp-server 8>, "
"E<.Xr sshd 8> E<.Rs> E<.%A T. Ylonen> E<.%A S. Lehtinen> E<.%T « SSH File "
"Transfer Protocol »> E<.%N draft-ietf-secsh-filexfer-00.txt> E<.%D janvier "
"2001> E<.%O travail en cours> E<.Re>"
